abstract: >-
  A governance evidence engine for machine-learning-based small business
  credit underwriting: synthetic monitoring, adverse-action reason generation
  and QA, fair-lending screening with statistical significance testing,
  BISG protected-class proxy estimation, less-discriminatory-alternative
  assessment, and reviewer-ready evidence packs.
